{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は4thに向けてのレッスンでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと気温も秋らしくなってきたー！\n秋の空気すき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかしメンバー内で風邪が\n流行ってきてるので気をつけなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも風邪ひかないよう\nからだあっためてくださいね><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の文化祭でね、\nお手伝いしたんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/0141918/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(勝手に作った)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに文化祭らしいことして\nすごい楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/0141918/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、この前仲良しの友達と\nご飯食べてきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/0141918/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サラダだらけ‼笑\n野菜たっぷりでヘルシー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/0141918/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子が喜ぶ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/0141918/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近アボカドとトマトに\n反応するようになってきた。\n前は苦手だったのに...\n食べられるようになったどころか\nすきになった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/0141918/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今苦手な、貝ときのこも\nいつかすきになるのかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとうございました。\n全部読みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたたかいです。\nこんなにたくさんの方々に支えされて\n私は本当に幸せなやつです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ未完成です。\nまだ華は小さいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも私は、\n自信をもって私らしく前を向きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/0141918/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へにゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/0141918/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな顔するのだって、私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}